- **DD row 57's back-reference** to `option_mapper_scope.contract_type` now points at the full-time/part-time mapper and should be repointed to `contract_duration_type`. My rename created this; it is a one-cell text fix in a different artifact, so I flagged it in the manifest's `_was` field rather than editing the DD unasked. **This is the one loose end from my changes.**

